                        "entry_id": "e104d643-f2ee-3064-822d-7d6f76aa2af0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Broken, cut or trimmed into pieces of a convenient size, or formed into small blocks; cobbled."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9120b6b7-530a-36c6-b98e-bc0b5bf6f450",
                        "entry_id": "e104d643-f2ee-3064-822d-7d6f76aa2af0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Remaining on, or taken from the cob, (as in \\\"cobbed corn\\\")."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22248cd5-d754-4b7d-ba75-939a46738eb5",
                                "sense_id": "9120b6b7-530a-36c6-b98e-bc0b5bf6f450",
                                "text": "After the few times I added cobbed corn to my bait pile, I would find cleaned cobs a long distance from the bait pile, sometimes more than 50 yards away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b077814-818b-420b-89c5-423f7c49f88e",
                                "sense_id": "9120b6b7-530a-36c6-b98e-bc0b5bf6f450",
                                "text": "I was thinking about you today, remembering all the good times we had when I was little: the picnics at the beach, cobbed corn and hamburgs on the grill, the long talks about the values of sharing and a good night's sleep."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3956fbd6-f205-4f43-bb8c-28bacab95279",
                                "sense_id": "9120b6b7-530a-36c6-b98e-bc0b5bf6f450",
                                "text": "A fluidized freezing process can be used for both cut corn and cobbed corn."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4a8d7f4-a0f3-38f8-a5c0-a516d58cd220",
                        "entry_id": "e104d643-f2ee-3064-822d-7d6f76aa2af0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Built of mud cobbles, and sealed with mud or an artificial equivalent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83635d7d-b77e-3e8d-a576-a8a44cd015c4",
                        "entry_id": "e104d643-f2ee-3064-822d-7d6f76aa2af0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Crudely or roughly assembled; put together in an improvised way, (as in \\\"cobbed together\\\")."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f22d71cf-9113-3d0a-8ee4-e6d6fd79cae3",
                        "entry_id": "e104d643-f2ee-3064-822d-7d6f76aa2af0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Struck with misfortune (possibly a contraction of clobbered)"
